OL,3,GNEWSAMinimum wage consultation extended
OL,4,Auntil September
OL,5,
OL,6,FA consultation into the future rates of
OL,7,Fminimum wage in Jersey has been
OL,8,Fextended.
OL,10,Fb@KThe Jersey Employment Forum said the
OL,11,Fconsultation was now due to end on 18
OL,12,FSeptember "in the light of recent
OL,13,Finterest".
OL,15,FThe forum is a statutory, non-political
OL,16,Fand independent body, made up of
OL,17,Femployee, employer and independent
OL,18,Frepresentatives.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
