OL,3,GNEWSAMinimum wage consultation extended
OL,4,Auntil September
OL,5,
OL,6,FJersey's chief minister, Lyndon Farnham
OL,7,Fsaid the government had "no plans" to
OL,8,Fabolish the island's minimum wage,
OL,9,Fwhich was increased from #13 an hour to
OL,10,F#13.59 in April.
